1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,500
A class can finish a test…

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,833
…without anyone knowing what each student needs next.

3
00:00:07,333 --> 00:00:10,333
Two students. The same 58%.

4
00:00:10,333 --> 00:00:13,833
Marks alone don't explain the learning gap.

5
00:00:14,333 --> 00:00:23,833
Assess. Diagnose. Practise. Verify. Improve.

6
00:00:24,333 --> 00:00:29,000
See the gap by topic — and the kind of mistake behind it.

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,833
Then check whether practice actually closed it.

8
00:00:34,333 --> 00:00:39,833
Heramb.study — Progress, made visible. Request early access.
